{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "But now I’m so thankful that I never had - a privilege passport - perfect English - rich husband", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:u000001"}], "text": "The author is thankful for never having had a privilege passport, perfect English, or a rich husband."}, "title": "Impact of Personal Challenges", "topic": "self-improvement"}, "content_hash": "0b44c5d6dca25a3778a6c11220cad1188f021cabe92b178adb2e5b023d567782", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:knowledge:ee79e40b6be10e11", "metadata_hash": "5bcddc5f1584a88da9f8153d19302760c330b28acd156734f983243eb5231592", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-02T09:24:11.283000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "c22b792d57617144248d7ae4cc871b3afde643a7b486aaaf217608066bb78780", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_being-born-in-a-small-city-im-the-end-of-activity-7467506341125906434-KnXi", "title": "Impact of Personal Challenges", "topic": "self-improvement", "topic_slug": "self-improvement"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Growing up in a Small city, moved to capital at 20, moved to India at 30, moved to Dubai at 34.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:u000001"}], "text": "The author moved from a small city to the capital at 20, then to India at 30, and to Dubai at 34."}, "title": "Career Journey", "topic": "career"}, "content_hash": "0b44c5d6dca25a3778a6c11220cad1188f021cabe92b178adb2e5b023d567782", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:knowledge:d8dcce697438ea0b", "metadata_hash": "5bcddc5f1584a88da9f8153d19302760c330b28acd156734f983243eb5231592", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-02T09:24:11.283000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "c22b792d57617144248d7ae4cc871b3afde643a7b486aaaf217608066bb78780", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_being-born-in-a-small-city-im-the-end-of-activity-7467506341125906434-KnXi", "title": "Career Journey", "topic": "career", "topic_slug": "career"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "And in Dubai I even changed my name a bit only… became Olla - now I can say about it with smile. Because Olga is too Russian/Ukeanian and in 2017 no one wanted to hire them because their English skills were below basic.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:u000001"}], "text": "The author changed their name to Olla in Dubai to appear neutral, as Russian/Ukrainian names were associated with poor English skills in 2017."}, "title": "Name Change Experience", "topic": "identity"}, "content_hash": "0b44c5d6dca25a3778a6c11220cad1188f021cabe92b178adb2e5b023d567782", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:knowledge:49eaa563700c0f27", "metadata_hash": "5bcddc5f1584a88da9f8153d19302760c330b28acd156734f983243eb5231592", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-02T09:24:11.283000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "c22b792d57617144248d7ae4cc871b3afde643a7b486aaaf217608066bb78780", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_being-born-in-a-small-city-im-the-end-of-activity-7467506341125906434-KnXi", "title": "Name Change Experience", "topic": "identity", "topic_slug": "identity"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "voice inside my head keeps “saying - whom do you think you are?! Who will listen to you?!” But the Good thing is - I’ve heard it so many times already - for my this “impostor voice” is just the evidence - I’m on a right track.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:u000002"}], "text": "The author acknowledges an internal 'impostor voice' as evidence of being on the right track, despite it suggesting doubts."}, "title": "Overcoming Impostor Syndrome", "topic": "self-improvement"}, "content_hash": "0b44c5d6dca25a3778a6c11220cad1188f021cabe92b178adb2e5b023d567782", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f:knowledge:29af235350e2a755", "metadata_hash": "5bcddc5f1584a88da9f8153d19302760c330b28acd156734f983243eb5231592", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-02T09:24:11.283000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "c22b792d57617144248d7ae4cc871b3afde643a7b486aaaf217608066bb78780", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-06-02-being-born-in-a-small-md-d9cffbc50f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_being-born-in-a-small-city-im-the-end-of-activity-7467506341125906434-KnXi", "title": "Overcoming Impostor Syndrome", "topic": "self-improvement", "topic_slug": "self-improvement"}
